      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $X,$ given by\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 7 & 6 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 9 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation ${R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-2{R}_{2}$ on $X?$",
